  "describe": "Black space with faint twinkling stars; a glowing yellow Sun in the middle, eight thin blue-grey orbit ellipses, Earth's orbit in light blue, small lit planets (Saturn with its ring), 'Earth' labelled with a pulsing ring; 'Solar System' and 'Year 2026.8' at the top; a dark panel below with Earth's facts, eight planet chips (Earth selected) and four speed chips (Week/s selected). Later the planets have moved round their orbits; a drag changes the tilt; tapping Saturn moves the highlight and the label; Year/s makes the year count up fast.",
